 <h3><u>Jeete Raho Auno Muhammad</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p><b><u><font size=4></font></u></b></p>
  <p><b><u><font size=4>Jeete Raho Auno Muhammad</font></u></b></p>
  <b><u><font size=4> </font></u></b>
  <p><font size=4>Al-amaa(n) hazar</font></p>
  <font size=4> <p>Kuchh aise lare jang mein zainab ke dulhare</p> <p>maidaan se udu bhage sabhi khof ke mare</p> <p>Ghulthakeran aisa kabhi parte nahin dekha</p> <p>bachhon ko is andaaz se larte nahin dekha</p> <p>barhte the kabhi gah sarak jaate the abbas</p> <p>jab waar who karte the to ye farmaate the abbas</p> <p>jeete raho auno Muhammad</p> <p>(Jeete raho auno Muhammad) x2</p> 
   <ol>
    <li>Tegh zameen ka hunar tumhi dikhate raho</li>
    <p>Khoon se talwaar ki pyaas bhujate raho</p>
    <p>dushmane shabbir ki hasti mitate raho</p>
    <p>haidari jaaho hasham aur barhate raho</p>
    <p>Aise laro phir hi kahein fatehe khaiber</p>
    <p>(Jeete raho auno Muhammad) x3</p>
    <li>Aise chale tegh ab dashto daman kaat de</li>
    <p>Waar karo sar pe tum kar who badan kaat de</p>
    <p>marhabo antar ke dil tere kafan kaatde</p>
    <p>Nehr ki har moj ko tashnadahan kaat de</p>
    <p>Jhoom ke khud teghe ali bole muqarrar</p>
    <p>(Jeete raho auno Muhammad) x3</p>
    <li>Qalb mein jaakar laro lashkare kuffar ke</li>
    <p>Chehr pe tewar rakho jafare tayyar ke</p>
    <p>Zarb mein andaaz ho haidare karrar ke</p>
    <p>Jag uthe dasht se ehle sitam haar ke</p>
    <p>Aye baqiyyah se sada doshe hawa par</p>
    <p>(Jeete raho auno Muhammad) x3</p>
    <li>Saye se talwar ke mot bhi bachkar chale</li>
    <p>Ek qadam aage na peeche ye lashkar chale</p>
    <p>Charon taraf dasht mein mot ka manzar chale</p>
    <p>Mot kahe kaam kya donon jari gar chale</p>
    <p>Mere hunar tumne dikhaye hein yahaan par</p>
    <p>(Jeete raho auno Muhammad) x3</p>
    <li>Har baar sada dete the ey gaysuo walo</li>
    <p>Kya kehna he phir bhar ke wahi haat nikalo</p>
    <p>Rahwar barhe jaate hein baaghon ko sambhalo</p>
    <p>Halka he kari aankh zira poshon pe dalo</p>
    <p>In hathon ke boson ke liye aye payambar</p>
    <p>Qasim bhi kahe mein bhi kahun aur ali akbar</p>
    <p>(Jeete raho auno Muhammad) x3</p>
    <li>Aun ye kehne lage khub Muhammad lare</li>
    <p>Goya Muhammad huwe aun bhi behad lare</p>
    <p>Maut ko bhi dasht mein karte huwe rad lare</p>
    <p>Donon lare is tarah jaise ab o jad lare</p>
    <p>Maa bhi dare khaima pe kehne lagi rokar</p>
    <p>(Jeete raho auno Muhammad) x3</p>
    <li>Larte huwe nehr par aagaye al akhtasar</li>
    <p>narghae ada mein phir girgaye donon pisar</p>
    <p>Teer kahin se chale aur kahin se tabar</p>
    <p>Shah ko awaz di girte huwe khaak par</p>
    <p>Pohonche shahe karbobala tha yahi lab par</p>
    <p>(Jeete raho auno Muhammad) x3</p>
    <li>Agaye abbas ki ankhon mein ashke aza</li>
    <p>Jeet gaye pyaas se nehr par who mehlaqa</p>
    <p>Nargae aada mein bhi donon ko ye yaad tha</p>
    <p>Maa ki naseehat pe hi hogaye donon fida</p>
    <p>Shukr ke sajde mein giri madare muztar</p>
    <p>(Jeete raho auno Muhammad) x3</p>
    <li>Donon ko maidan se khaime mein laye Hussain</li>
    <p>Halqa kiye lashon ka karne lage sab hi bain</p>
    <p>Fizza ne awaz di binte shahe mashreqain</p>
    <p>Shah pe sadqe huwe dekh tere nure ain</p>
    <p>Zainabe muztar ne kaha shane hila kar</p>
    <p>(Jeete raho auno Muhammad) x3</p>
    <li>Kya hashr tha khaime mein bapa mazharo irfan</li>
   </ol> <p>Shabbir jo lasho(n) pe huwe lashon chaak girehban</p> <p>Lashon se mukhatib yun huwi zainabe zishan</p> <p>Tum bhai pe qurban huwe tujpe mein qurban</p> <p>Jo kehke chale ghar se wohi karke dikhaya</p> <p>Ab qadr huwi maa ko bara fakhr he tumpar</p> <p>(Jeete raho auno Muhammad) x3</p></font>
